1
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:52,670
{\an8}[A Good Day to Ascend]

2
00:01:54,600 --> 00:02:00,780
{\an8}[Previously on A Good Day to Ascend]

3
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,758
When the sun sets
in the outside world,

4
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:59,499
the Nai River will reappear,
the Phantom Realm will invade,

5
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,479
and the Great Temple Zone
will return to the Phantom Realm.

6
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,410
All the deity statues will revive.

7
00:02:03,610 --> 00:02:06,839
They are about to go on a killing spree.

8
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,099
Merge with me!

9
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:09,620
Become me!

10
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,999
I will give you supreme glory

11
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,920
and eternal life!

12
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:20,810
They actually killed
the Judicial Adviser of Yongzhou,

13
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,079
Zhou Zheng.

14
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:29,740
{\an8}[Episode 21:
White Bone Strikes the Deities]

15
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:38,640
There's someone behind the tree.

16
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:49,940
Oh no, I've been spotted.

17
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,060
It's an impermanence spirit.

18
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,220
That was close.

19
00:03:13,470 --> 00:03:14,870
I finally fooled them.

20
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:16,400
Eh.

21
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:19,679
I can actually understand the gibberish
of these spirits and deities.

22
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,960
What a magical mask.

23
00:03:22,110 --> 00:03:23,630
Take this.

24
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:31,280
Follow me.

25
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,720
Come here.

26
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,680
This guy looks sneaky.

27
00:04:26,930 --> 00:04:28,410
Coward.

28
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:44,640
Have this impermanence spirit
hold the panacea.

29
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:56,720
That's a lot of panaceas.

30
00:04:57,550 --> 00:04:58,519
If I pocket them

31
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,600
and run for it...

32
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:05,290
I'd definitely die a miserable death.

33
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,479
The panacea is probably meant to be

34
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:11,010
offered to that
White-Clothed Nuo Immortal.

35
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:13,550
These deities can't tell our identities,

36
00:05:13,710 --> 00:05:15,839
but the White-Clothed Nuo Immortal
has seen it all.

37
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:19,170
He'll definitely know
that I'm a fake impermanence spirit.

38
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,280
I can't follow them anymore.

39
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:31,500
Keep up.

40
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,080
This damn guy

41
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,520
is still watching me.

42
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:40,640
I'll eat all these panaceas.

43
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:43,399
Let's see how you report
to the Nuo Immortal.

44
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,060
We'll all be doomed together.

45
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,720
I can't just eat them.

46
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:56,280
Let me add some ingredients for you.

47
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,200
I'm free.

48
00:06:12,890 --> 00:06:14,660
I knew it wouldn't be that easy.

49
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:37,370
After being hunted for so long,

50
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,519
this Nuo Immortal probably
doesn't even have

51
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:41,380
one percent of his peak strength.

52
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:47,000
Let's go block the entrance!

53
00:06:48,610 --> 00:06:50,759
Going to the Shuikou Temple entrance?

54
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,769
That's great.

55
00:06:51,770 --> 00:06:53,450
Perfect time to escape.

56
00:07:05,930 --> 00:07:08,279
With so many deities guarding this place,

57
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,889
anyone inside
will have a hard time getting out.

58
00:07:10,890 --> 00:07:13,220
I hope Mr. Bell and Yuanqi
already got out.

59
00:07:19,370 --> 00:07:21,179
As long as we walk out of this door,

60
00:07:21,180 --> 00:07:22,380
we will be free.

61
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,000
I never want

62
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,410
to come back to this damn temple.

63
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:46,970
Look at you, scared stiff.

64
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:48,408
What's there to be afraid of with us here?

65
00:07:48,409 --> 00:07:49,770
Coward.

66
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,949
This guy's got a long tongue

67
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:58,400
but no guts.

68
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,690
The mask is falling off.

69
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,720
Let me toughen him up.

70
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,520
Oh crap!

71
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,120
He's a fraud!

72
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:36,340
This fraud has the panaceas!

73
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:39,380
Chase him! Go, go!

74
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:45,069
Ying really does have Heaven on his side.

75
00:08:45,070 --> 00:08:45,680
Ying!

76
00:09:17,290 --> 00:09:18,090
Block!

77
00:09:20,130 --> 00:09:21,330
It actually works.

78
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:23,920
These panaceas
really are priceless.

79
00:09:25,810 --> 00:09:26,680
Block!

80
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,000
Dodge!

81
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:31,800
Dodge!

82
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:32,600
Block!

83
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,000
You want them?

84
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,020
Take them back.

85
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,119
Here you go!

86
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,720
Chase him!

87
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,570
Go after him!

88
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,240
Ying!

89
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,660
Why are they still chasing me?

90
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,919
There's only one left behind us.

91
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,359
Turn around and fight it!

92
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,220
I can't beat it.

93
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,170
Mr. Bell.

94
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,679
I've kept you for a thousand days
just for this moment.

95
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,119
Can you unleash
your divine power and blast it?

96
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,619
Blast it, my ass!

97
00:10:10,620 --> 00:10:12,479
If you had really
kept me for a thousand days,

98
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:14,880
I could smash ten of them to death!

99
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,960
Just run!

100
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,960
It hurts so much!

101
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,840
Is it really that bad?

102
00:10:39,830 --> 00:10:41,479
This is the Soul-Beating Whip.

103
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,859
The moment it touches you,

104
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,369
it strikes your deity soul.

105
00:10:44,370 --> 00:10:45,509
The pain is unbearable.

106
00:10:45,510 --> 00:10:46,950
No one can endure it.

107
00:10:49,850 --> 00:10:52,490
I felt a little dizzy just now.

108
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:54,350
Mr. Bell, what did you just say?

109
00:11:10,070 --> 00:11:11,150
I get it now.

110
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,840
Is this Soul-Beating Whip broken?

111
00:11:19,130 --> 00:11:21,370
Could it be that I ate a lot of panaceas,

112
00:11:21,930 --> 00:11:24,190
so this Soul-Beating Whip can't hurt me?

113
00:11:39,310 --> 00:11:40,350
Ying!

114
00:11:58,970 --> 00:12:00,630
Does it really hurt that much?

115
00:12:15,490 --> 00:12:17,279
It can even
break the incense flying sword.

116
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,400
What a treasure.

117
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,120
Nice!

118
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,159
Let's go back to Mount Prudence.

119
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,920
You're really amazing.

120
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,360
Young friend.

121
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:44,680
Why not come and sit for a while?

122
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,640
Ying.

123
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,639
He's not here for anything good.

124
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,080
He's set up a table here.

125
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,599
Clearly he's been waiting a long time.

126
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,200
He won't let us leave easily.

127
00:13:15,410 --> 00:13:17,290
Old man, do you know me?

128
00:13:17,570 --> 00:13:18,760
I do.

129
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,440
I even held you

130
00:13:21,010 --> 00:13:22,970
when you were little.

131
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,280
Why don't I remember you?

132
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:28,520
My family lives in Xujiaping.

133
00:13:29,070 --> 00:13:31,509
My father is the third child,
named Xu Sanlang.

134
00:13:31,510 --> 00:13:34,279
My mother is from the neighboring village,
named Luo Yinghua.

135
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,079
I'm the second child in the family.

136
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,340
I have an older sister.

137
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:39,600
No.

138
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:41,020
I don't...

139
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:42,729
I don't have an older sister.

140
00:13:42,730 --> 00:13:44,759
Oh no, Ying is having an episode again.

141
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:48,000
You've had headaches
since you were little.

142
00:13:48,890 --> 00:13:49,650
Ying!

143
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:52,000
It still hasn't been cured.

144
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:55,410
You poor thing.

145
00:13:55,930 --> 00:13:57,130
Please.

146
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:00,520
Drink it.

147
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:04,360
You must be thirsty after walking so far.

148
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,920
Old man, you must know

149
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,840
a lot about my childhood, right?

150
00:14:19,610 --> 00:14:21,279
Brat.

151
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:24,480
That little spirit
who plays with the big snake,

152
00:14:25,210 --> 00:14:27,850
where are you hiding?

153
00:14:28,170 --> 00:14:29,599
Come out!

154
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:31,640
It can't find you here.

155
00:14:32,490 --> 00:14:34,810
Just rest assured.

156
00:14:46,780 --> 00:14:47,820
Qi cultivator?

157
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,219
Didn't the girl in the coffin say

158
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:52,420
that Qi cultivators have gone extinct?

159
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:55,440
Where does this sorrowful
old man come from?

160
00:14:56,520 --> 00:15:02,120
The Nuo Immortal of Shuikou Temple
was named Chen Mianzhu.

161
00:15:02,710 --> 00:15:05,510
He was truly astonishingly talented,

162
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:08,000
and blessed with great fortune.

163
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:11,039
After learning the Nuo Shaman inheritance,

164
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:12,880
he released the Yujing Secret.

165
00:15:13,750 --> 00:15:15,270
In just a hundred years,

166
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:18,600
he cultivated to the Nuo Immortal realm.

167
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,840
When he became a Nuo Immortal,

168
00:15:22,310 --> 00:15:25,430
he felt his lifespan was limited.

169
00:15:26,230 --> 00:15:28,970
So he built Shuikou Temple

170
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:31,050
to connect Yin and Yang,

171
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:35,520
wanting to be an undying Nuo Immortal.

172
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:38,920
Until one day—

173
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,600
Until one day,

174
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,180
a sword came striking.

175
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:45,199
A peerless expert
entered his cultivation place

176
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,360
and killed him.

177
00:15:46,740 --> 00:15:48,540
He didn't kill him,

178
00:15:49,450 --> 00:15:51,770
but ate him.

179
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:54,190
Ate him?

180
00:15:54,650 --> 00:15:56,370
He ate him clean,

181
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:59,740
not wasting a single bit,

182
00:16:00,340 --> 00:16:03,140
leaving only his skin.

183
00:16:10,730 --> 00:16:11,650
Ying!

184
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:17,720
That's why his resentment
is so overwhelming.

185
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:22,470
Now only a trace of
his consciousness remains.

186
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,080
No wonder his power seems so strong,

187
00:16:27,190 --> 00:16:28,350
yet not that strong.

188
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:35,590
Young Master Xu, please be on your way.

189
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:39,720
Ying.

190
00:16:40,710 --> 00:16:41,370
Ying!

191
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,180
Thank you, old man.

192
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,160
I'll be going.

193
00:16:59,690 --> 00:17:01,090
This is great.

194
00:17:01,990 --> 00:17:04,510
Now I can have peace for a few decades.

195
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:05,259
Mr. Bell.

196
00:17:05,260 --> 00:17:05,720
Yuanqi.

197
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,290
Back to Mount Prudence.

198
00:17:08,810 --> 00:17:09,569
Okay.

199
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:13,560
What's going on?

200
00:17:18,349 --> 00:17:21,790
Meng Po, you really watered down this tea.

201
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,680
Where's my umbrella?

202
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:38,260
Which bastard stole my umbrella?

203
00:17:59,890 --> 00:18:06,320
{\an8}[In the next episode]

204
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:02,720
Rise!

205
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,800
Take them down!

206
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:09,720
This person is so strong.

207
00:18:10,330 --> 00:18:11,570
If we fight him,

208
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:14,440
I will die.

